{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/690f2e8159fa116f0cb8e4455498c96a.avif?t=1770204229\" width=1080 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubble Investor</strong> is a strategic investment game where you run your own <strong>bubble company</strong>. Inflate each bubble to increase its value, pull out your money before it bursts, and reinvest your profits to expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1770204229\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in dynamic bubbles</strong>: Inflate them to increase value and cash out at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the burst</strong>: If a bubble pops, you lose your investment\u2014manage your risk carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new bubble types</strong> with unique behaviors, risks, and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your company</strong> with upgrades, tools, and more inventory slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire specialized staff</strong> to gain powerful strategic boosts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economists</strong>: Exclusive discounts in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analysts</strong>: Approximate predictions of burst points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawyers</strong>: Insurance to recover part of your money on failed bubbles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more assistants to help your company grow.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1770204229\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW FEATURES &amp; IMPROVEMENTS</strong> <strong><i>(included in the new demo)</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger inventory</strong> allowing you to manage more bubbles simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company upgrades</strong> that increase your maximum investment limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete bubble rebalance</strong> for smoother and fairer progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Higher burst thresholds</strong> at early levels for a more relaxed start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No more Game Over</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of bubbles \u2192 buy new ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of money \u2192 your <strong>investors provide emergency funds</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But until you repay the debt, some company features will be <strong>temporarily restricted</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow wisely\u2026 or grow in debt.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1770204229\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER <i>(arriving April)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>multiplayer mode</strong> will let you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your online company</strong> and hire friends as subcontractors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in the shared market</strong> against rival corporations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>cooperatively or competitively</strong> as you grow your bubble empire together \u2014 or sabotage each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an empire\u2026 or watch it burst in real time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1770204229\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY TO BUILD THE BIGGEST BUBBLE EMPIRE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest smart. Manage risk. Expand your company. Become the ultimate <strong>Bubble Investor</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839840?t=1770204229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/05ddffd73fa626a93a8d83e186fb15c9f19a6ee2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770204229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/3ce2da4fc3e714e101a70a8be7de177c7bb32045/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770204229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/3ce2da4fc3e714e101a70a8be7de177c7bb32045/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770204229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4010450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas